add('contest_concept_done','LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ThatsAllForInterview','A reporter thanks the player for their interpretation of a contest concept and possible TV story ideas.','''soft_smile~Our idea gave them another idea. Thoughts are very good at making little cousins.|Different interpretations can give a familiar subject a useful new angle.|Glad the answer helped. They can build from it.|It feels nice when an awkward explanation actually makes sense to someone.|A shared idea can become something neither person had alone.|Our brief interpretation has volunteered for a possible career in television.|The thought has left our head and acquired professional ambitions.|A fresh perspective can be more useful than repeating the usual description.|One person's impression can open a little space in another's thinking.|An interesting interpretation can change the whole look of a story.|I would be curious which part of our answer stays with them.''')
add('briney_rescue','RusturfTunnel_Text_ThankYouLetsGoHomePeeko','Mr Briney thanks the player for rescuing Peeko, offers help and takes the bird home; field control returns after departure.','''soft_smile~Peeko is going home. That little chirp is the best part of the whole cave.|The rescue is complete, and the gratitude seems deeply sincere.|Glad Peeko is safe. They can get home now.|The way he calls her home is so gentle.|Someone getting their beloved friend back is worth the trouble.|A frightened little story has found a warm cottage to end in.|The cave has finally produced a thoroughly welcome goodbye.|Good to know the rescue ended with both of them able to leave safely.|One small life has made the whole tunnel feel lighter.|That is a lovely reunion to have helped bring about.|I would remember how his voice changed once Peeko was safe.''')
