add('pokerus_explanation','gText_PokerusExplanation','A nurse explains a possible Pokerus infection and the limited knowledge of its microscopic life-forms and reported growth effect.','''surprised~Tiny life-forms with a big effect. Our partner has become even more surprising.|A fascinating observation. I appreciate that the nurse stated what remains uncertain.|Good that she told us. Keep an eye on our partner.|That is unexpected. I would want to know how our friend is feeling.|I am glad someone knowledgeable explained what they noticed.|A very small discovery has made our familiar companion newly mysterious.|The microscopic world has made a rather conspicuous entrance.|Something we cannot see can still change a great deal. Remarkable.|There are lives within the little lives we already know.|A surprising detail does not change how carefully we should treat our partner.|I would ask what the nurse has observed in other Pokemon.''')
